        "25th"
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "(b) 27th",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$a_n = S_n - S_{n-1}$.",
        "$a_n = (3n^2+5n) - (3(n-1)^2+5(n-1)) = 6n+2$.",
